WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.590
Most Christmas cards show
shepherds and a manger.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.880
Matthew's Gospel has neither.

3
00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:08.440
Matthew tells it from Joseph's side.

4
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.190
An angel speaks to him in a dream.

5
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.680
Wise men follow a star
from the East to Jerusalem.

6
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.590
They ask for the newborn King of the Jews.

7
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:22.310
And King Herod, hearing of a rival
king, wants the child destroyed.

8
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.510
So why does Matthew tell
Jesus' birth through dreams,

9
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:28.080
a star and a jealous king?

10
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.880
In this mission, you'll
follow Joseph's choices,

11
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.200
and the gifts of gold,
frankincense and myrrh.

12
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:39.160
Then you'll trace the escape into Egypt,
and the titles Matthew gives Jesus.

13
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:43.820
Your mission: find out why Matthew
tells Jesus' birth through dreams,

14
00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.870
a star and a jealous king.
